### 2. ✅ Modifications Allowed

You are welcome to modify, extend, and create derivative works based on this project, including but not limited to:

- Modifying source code to meet personal needs
- Adding new features or improving existing ones
- Fixing bugs and optimizing performance
- Creating derivative projects

### 3. 🎨 Attribution Required

When creating derivative works, you must clearly indicate the original author information in the following locations:

- Header comments in source code files
- Project README documentation
- Software "About" page or similar interface
- Any publicly released derivative works

Attribution format should include:
```
