```

### 4. 🔓 Derivatives Must Be Open Source

All derivative works based on MCTier's **own code** must (this section does not apply to the third-party LGPL-3.0 components described in Section 5, such as EasyTier):

- Be open sourced under the same license terms
- Make complete source code publicly available
